Test Case 1 – Credit Card Payment

Test Case ID: TC_payment_001

Test Description: Verify that the user can make a product payment using a Credit Card.

Test Steps:
Open Flipkart
Select a product
Add the product to the cart
Proceed to checkout
Select Credit Card as the payment method
Enter valid card details
Click Pay/Place Order.

Test Data:
Valid Credit Card number, expiry date, and cardholder name.

Expected Result:
Payment should be processed successfully and the order should be placed successfully.

Test Case 2 – UPI Payment

Test Case ID: TC_payment_002

Test Description: Verify that the user can make a product payment using UPI.

Test Steps:
Open Flipkart
Select a product
Add the product to the cart
Proceed to checkout
Select UPI as the payment method
Enter a valid UPI ID
Complete the UPI payment

Test Data:
Valid UPI ID.

Expected Result:
UPI payment should be processed successfully and the order should be placed successfully.
